# What the image build never needs. `.pnpmfile.cjs` is not listed on purpose: pnpm reads it at install, and without it a second copy of Next is resolved.
.git
.claude
.local
.turbo
.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.next*
**/out
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/*.log
# No environment file ever goes into an image: settings come from the platform at run time.
.env
.env.*
